CENTELHA COMUNIDADE CRISTÃ.

Clovis is a voice coach for property negotiation, provided entirely by artificial intelligence. There is no human coach. You speak out loud. Clovis plays the seller, then debriefs you and gives you a mark out of 30.

The method is that of Thierry Armand, estate agent and trainer. He has worked in property negotiation for 28 years, including more than twenty years in Montréal. There are eight modules, a 30-day programme, a scoring grid, and a final assessment.

You can:
- follow the programme day by day, including offline;
- practise a specific subject (valuation, fees, a mandate, a first call or a price reduction) or rehearse for a few minutes before a meeting;
- consult the pocket law guide for France, Québec and the United Kingdom, also offline;
- turn on a local reminder, on your phone, for the day’s exercise;
- take the final assessment and, if you reach the threshold set out in the programme, receive a named end-of-training attestation as a PDF, in French or in English.

The end-of-training attestation is not an official title. It is not a state diploma, an RNCP certification, an ALUR- or OACIQ-accredited course, or a Qualiopi qualification.

The pocket law notes are working references. They are not legal advice. For a specific situation, consult a qualified professional in the country concerned.

Languages and countries: French and British English, for professionals working in France, Québec or the United Kingdom.

A microphone and an internet connection are required for voice sessions. If you decline the microphone, the programme and the pocket law guide remain usable.

Your progress and scores currently stay on your device. Voice sessions are carried by the coach’s technical provider (ElevenLabs) for the duration of the conversation.

iDealStore — магазин техники и аксессуаров в Москве.

В приложении вы можете:
• смотреть актуальный каталог и цены;
• выбирать цвет, память и вариант SIM;
• добавлять товары в избранное и корзину;
• оформлять доставку или самовывоз;
• отправлять заявку на кредит или рассрочку;
• оценивать устройство по программе Trade‑in;
• получать бонусы и следить за заказами в профиле.

Самовывоз: Москва, ул. Барклая, 8, павильон 123.
